        "fadetime": "1,block=true"
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[Delay(time=1)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   'Kidnap Bison, split Penguin Logistics and MDL, rub out Emperor,' that was your great plan.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "'Kidnap Bison, split Penguin Logistics and MDL, rub out Emperor,' that was your great plan."
    },
    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028\",name2=\"avg_npc_027#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[name=\"Capone\"]   Our goal is to take their place. No need to bury those idiots. I think you can do the math on this one?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Capone",
        "content": "Our goal is to take their place. No need to bury those idiots. I think you can do the math on this one?"
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028\",name2=\"avg_npc_027#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   Texas, she's Texas. Then you got the Laterano girl and the MDL princeling. You think we can leave 'em breathing and still sleep at night?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "Texas, she's Texas. Then you got the Laterano girl and the MDL princeling. You think we can leave 'em breathing and still sleep at night?"
    },
    {
        "id": 135,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   We gotta salt the earth here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "We gotta salt the earth here."
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028\",name2=\"avg_npc_027#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[name=\"Capone\"]   That's a good way to get a lot of eyes on us. We ain't the only seat at this table.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Capone",
        "content": "That's a good way to get a lot of eyes on us. We ain't the only seat at this table."
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028#3\",name2=\"avg_npc_027#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   Hah! You scared?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "Hah! You scared?"
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028#3\",name2=\"avg_npc_027#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 141,
        "raw": "[name=\"Capone\"]   Gotta know when to fold 'em, cazzo.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Capone",
        "content": "Gotta know when to fold 'em, cazzo."
    },
    {
        "id": 142,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028#3\",name2=\"avg_npc_027#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 143,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   Getting down on my hands and knees for the Rat King was as low as I'm ever gonna go. All this time in Lungmen's turned you coward. Scared of your own damned tail.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "Getting down on my hands and knees for the Rat King was as low as I'm ever gonna go. All this time in Lungmen's turned you coward. Scared of your own damned tail."
    },
    {
        "id": 144,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   You done a lot for the Family, but you're lucky I ain't kicked you to the curb yet.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "You done a lot for the Family, but you're lucky I ain't kicked you to the curb yet."
    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028#3\",name2=\"avg_npc_027#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 146,
        "raw": "[name=\"Capone\"]   You do what you gotta do. We can come back to that one.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Capone",
        "content": "You do what you gotta do. We can come back to that one."
    },
    {
        "id": 147,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028\",name2=\"avg_npc_027#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 148,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   Damn right. Now I gotta deal with Penguin Logistics my way.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "Damn right. Now I gotta deal with Penguin Logistics my way."
    },
    {
        "id": 149,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   A stiff can't come back and bite you in the ass, capiche?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "A stiff can't come back and bite you in the ass, capiche?"
    },
    {
        "id": 150,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028\",name2=\"avg_npc_027\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 151,
        "raw": "[name=\"Capone\"]   ...you do it your way. But I'm just gonna warn you one last time: this ain't Siracusa. We're in Lungmen now.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Capone",
        "content": "...you do it your way. But I'm just gonna warn you one last time: this ain't Siracusa. We're in Lungmen now."
    },
    {
        "id": 152,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_028\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028"
    },
    {
        "id": 153,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   And it's after we blew it in Siracusa that I realized: we don't pass up an opportunity. We're not gonna compromise, negotiate, and fall into another trap.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "And it's after we blew it in Siracusa that I realized: we don't pass up an opportunity. We're not gonna compromise, negotiate, and fall into another trap."
    },
    {
        "id": 154,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   We're gonna use everything we got to totally wipe out the competition.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "We're gonna use everything we got to totally wipe out the competition."
    },
    {
        "id": 155,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gambino\"]   We're gonna do this the old way, like the true Sicilians we are.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gambino",
        "content": "We're gonna do this the old way, like the true Sicilians we are."
    },
